cancels; a step marked "across" subtracts overheads measured against
baselines at two rates.

| Stage | Rate (req/s) | Total p50 (ms) | Total p99 (ms) | TTFT p50 (ms) | TTFT p99 (ms) |
|-------|-------------:|---------------:|---------------:|--------------:|--------------:|
| none (against direct) | 200 | +0.38 [+0.34, +0.41] | +0.11 [-0.27, +0.44] | +0.38 [+0.34, +0.41] | +0.11 [-0.27, +0.48] |
| + limits | 200 | +0.30 [+0.26, +0.34] | +0.30 [-0.12, +0.76] | +0.30 [+0.26, +0.34] | +0.30 [-0.12, +0.72] |
| + exact | 200 | +0.30 [+0.26, +0.34] | +1.30 [+0.88, +1.72] | +0.30 [+0.26, +0.34] | +1.30 [+0.84, +1.72] |
